<section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-32 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent-primary font-mono text-sm">>_ ABOUT</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary">Mission, Not Marketing</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-text-primary">
          Cathedral Cyber was built on a simple premise: the best way to defend against sophisticated adversaries is to think like one.
        </p>
        <p>
          We specialize in full-scope red team operations and adversary simulation for defense contractors and federal agencies. No assumptions. No templated reports. Just rigorous, repeatable security testing that exposes real risk.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our engagements are designed to mirror nation-state tactics, techniques, and procedures — giving your defenders a realistic, high-fidelity training ground and your leadership a clear picture of organizational resilience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-accent-primary">26+</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted font-mono">Years Combined Experience</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-accent-secondary">0</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted font-mono">Assumptions Made</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-accent-tertiary">Fed</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted font-mono">Defense Contractor Focus</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary">100%</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted font-mono">Adversarial Mindset</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
